-#
  One chunk of job output, appended to #install-log by AppInstallJob.

  `text` already contains newlines, so it is emitted as a single text node inside a <pre>.
  Splitting into lines here would be wrong: a chunk can end mid-line (the daemon caps replies
  at 64KB), and breaking it would insert a newline that is not in the output.

-# `html` escapes; the raw text may contain anything the install script printed.
%span.install-log-chunk= text
